{
  "title": "로그인 후 작성한 게시글",
  "content": "JWT 토큰 인증 성공! 야호!"
}

### 토큰으로 게시글 작성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0QHRlc3QuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgyMDQyNzE0LCJleHAiOjE3ODIxMjkxMTR9.BIWIkmj5Qm9phxMwPiJ0k5b0tlFi6RDpRx2v0c2AyDY

{
