  "content": "JWT 토큰 인증 성공!"
}


### 게시글 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/posts/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0MkB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc4MTI3MDgyMywiZXhwIjoxNzgxMzU3MjIzfQ.loUfP-DKW8uEJspSfcCnJz5jDd5KeEuKlO6lXaIbIRQ

{
  "title": "수정된 제목2",
  "content": "수정된 내용2"
}

### 게시글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0QHRlc3QuY29tIiwiaWF0IjoxNzgxMjYxNDIzLCJleHAiOjE3ODEzNDc4MjN9.vJoONEXg2xn9yHgAlZmoYtWGpqlCxOJJh3JXM_fAqzA

### 토큰 없이 게시글 작성 시도
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "토큰 없이 작성",
  "content": "실패해야 함"
}

### 다른 사람 게시글 수정 시도 (없는 토큰)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 이상한토큰값

{
  "title": "해킹 시도",
  "content": "실패해야 함"
}

### 게시글 목록 조회 (페이징)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?page=0&size=5

### 게시글 검색
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/search?keyword=게시글&page=0&size=10

### 최신순 조회 (기본값)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?page=0&size=10&sort=latest

### 오래된순 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?page=0&size=10&sort=oldest

### 조회수순 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?page=0&size=10&sort=popular

### 게시글 상세 조회 (게시글 + 댓글 한번에)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1/detail
